From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:34:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): hold requests to a starting gateway until it
 is ready

gateway.listener_start_hold_seconds (0 = off): while the gateway starts, a request to its listener waits up to that bound for READY instead of the 503 gateway_not_ready answer, and a WebSocket upgrade instead of close 1013. A stop that begins meanwhile answers at once. A takeover then looks like latency to clients instead of a failure.
